      "formula": "(sum(u_i) - sum(d_i)) / (sum(u_i) + sum(d_i)) over active 09:31-11:30 and 13:01-15:00 bars, where vwap_i=amount_i/volume_i, u_i=log(high_i/vwap_i), and d_i=log(vwap_i/low_i)",
