      "zero_missing_denominator_semantics": "Joint-zero volume and amount is inactive with zero contribution. Require exact positive finite low<=high, nonnegative finite activity, no one-sided zero, exact active-bar low<=amount/volume<=high containment, at least 120 positive-range active bars, and a finite positive total active log range; never repair, clamp, add epsilon, or substitute zero.",
